# Waltz of Rage's ruling (CR 608.2b, 2024-09-20): if the target creature is illegal as it tries to resolve, it doesn't resolve and none of its effects happen: no damage, and the
# delayed triggered ability is never made, so a creature of yours dying later this turn exiles nothing. Bot2 Bolts the targeted Bear in response, Waltz is countered on resolution:
# Memnite and Elvish Mystic take no damage; then Bot2 Bolts Memnite and it dies without exiling the top card of the library.

